      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KV bytes = 2 * layers * batch * tokens * kv_heads * head_dim * bytes_per_elem\n2 表示 K 和 V；GQA/MQA 主要通过减少 kv_heads 降低 cache 体积",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KV bytes = 2 * layers * batch * tokens * kv_heads * head_dim * bytes_per_elem\n2 表示 K 和 V；GQA/MQA 主要通过减少 kv_heads 降低 cache 体积",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
